			<text>'mayhem_bailingChanceMult'</text>
		</line>
		<line linenr="014" indent="&#160;" />
		<line linenr="015" indent="&#160;">
			<comment>* Add-Ons 1.9.3: Fighter bailing is now determined upon creation. 2 categories: big ships (M6, TM, M8, M1, M2, M7) and fighters (M3, M4, M5). </comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="016" indent="&#160;">
			<comment>* TL, TP, and TS cannot bail.</comment>
