			<text> </text>
			<var>[TRUE]</var>
		</line>
		<line linenr="027" indent="&#160;&#160;&#160;">
			<comment>* M6/TM/M8 - 3%. While the Percentage is lower than the capital ships, there are FAR more M6's in the game and we don't want bailed M6's littered all over.</comment>
