		</line>
		<line linenr="054" indent="&#160;&#160;" />
		<line linenr="055" indent="&#160;&#160;">
			<comment>* Add-Ons 1.9.3: Enforce a minimum 1% chance to bail. Not for TLs.</comment>
		</line>
		<line linenr="056" indent="&#160;&#160;">
			<text>do</text>
			<text> </text>
